        "",
        "/** Constant-flow char selection",
        " *",
        " * \\param low   Secret. Bottom of range",
        " * \\param high  Secret. Top of range",
        " * \\param c     Secret. Value to compare to range",
        " * \\param t     Secret. Value to return, if in range",
