        "/** Fast quasi-reduction modulo p192k1 = 2^192 - R,",
        " * with R = 2^32 + 2^12 + 2^8 + 2^7 + 2^6 + 2^3 + 1 = 0x01000011C9",
        " *",
        " * \\param[in,out]   X       The address of the MPI to be converted.",
        " *                          Must have exact limb size that stores a 384-bit MPI",
